Modifications in this distribution include integration of the Despoina
PE/cluster/array, scheduler, finite staging/cache, indexer, exact dynamic
row-mean, DCIM, and DRAMsim3 paths; a standalone build; synthetic local
validation; removal of MongoDB/network/notification/visualizer/external
executable hooks; fail-closed result-directory handling; and exclusion of all
competitor baselines and private experiment workflows/data/results.

